      "allowSystem": false,
      "confirm": false,
      "doc": "Splits a block in two at a character. The text from `at` on moves, with\nits formatting, to a new block of the same type, depth and attributes\nright after it, whose id is returned. The head keeps the block's id.\nEmits `BlockInserted` and `BlockChanged`.",
